WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:03,290
Why is this floor full of laboratories?

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:04,690
What about the living area?

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:19,240
Are you making a move? Didn't you lie down and do a physical examination first?

4
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:26,630
What kind of physical examination requires locking people up and letting me go?
